(Section 2: Hallucination Rates and Verifiability) Tj T*
(Fine-tuned models still hallucinate in 18% of domain-specific edge cases because facts) Tj T*
(are stored implicitly in weight distributions.) Tj T*
(RAG solves this by forcing the model to cite exact source excerpts and page numbers.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Contrasting Perspective on Page 2:) Tj T*
(While fine-tuning is superior for teaching specific linguistic styles or strict code formats,) Tj T*
(RAG is the undisputed standard for document discovery, compliance, and factual research.) Tj T*
ET
