(Section 3: Hybrid Deployment Guidelines) Tj T*
(The ideal enterprise architecture combines a fast, compact foundation model \(such as) Tj T*
(gemini-2.5-flash\) with dynamic RAG vector indexing.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Operational Conclusions:) Tj T*
(1. Use RAG for real-time document search, Q&A, and policy adherence.) Tj T*
(2. Avoid static fine-tuning when source PDFs change weekly or monthly.) Tj T*
(3. Enable multi-document comparative indexing to detect discrepancies across contracts.) Tj T*
